                                <l xml:id="m-bcd4abdb-1613-4c74-84d3-3880ed5e6b7e" facs="#m-6b345373-d263-4b98-b430-e27159214558" label="ambiguous">1004</l><l xml:id="m-5525a17f-beab-4d6b-86b5-0d4ec8223302" facs="#m-04df07cc-f904-4757-b3b9-bb10e5842268" label="text-like">5th Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-27295236-e34e-4bf9-8e9a-45fe69b410a8" facs="#m-2b5028e1-0b6a-40c3-914b-4297366008b1" label="lyrics-like">V: Dó-mi¬ ne,</l><l xml:id="m-ed463128-995f-43ed-a5b4-d3bed29949f2" facs="#m-4ee117a2-f20c-4189-a2d5-fb352d51b984" label="lyrics-like">in vir- tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-953db89c-4c6e-4139-9a1c-e298799d64c1" facs="#m-bcc893bd-730a-407e-9360-be1ca587186e" label="lyrics-like">te tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-ab1d23f2-329c-4889-9bc7-c0a538b72c0c" facs="#m-6ad06ffc-0b54-4179-a602-fdb29b58a40d" label="ambiguous">bi- tur</l><l xml:id="m-73d8aa15-2a2b-43b1-99ed-4d767ab09b46" facs="#m-c20776de-d445-4b41-a3b6-5c1905fa2cc7" label="lyrics-like">a laetá¬</l><l xml:id="m-56cc7ad6-dbe6-41a3-962d-32eac71dc9b9" facs="#m-4531d0f9-9f7d-41a4-91d7-f260b2ff208b" label="ambiguous">rex:</l><l xml:id="m-002ecdfa-84f5-4781-9208-a226249c42b3" facs="#m-0e4b3f53-7fad-4665-9059-e66909d2adb7" label="ambiguous">et</l><l xml:id="m-9eb149e4-395a-44f2-bff6-e0d1bd162423" facs="#m-db02eed9-ca37-4b28-80fb-32931e68afc1" label="ambiguous">su-per</l><l xml:id="m-248ee602-a782-4ec2-8e09-00bf321de7f1" facs="#m-0d80cfba-9a1e-446b-862e-3519f87c084f" label="ambiguous">bit</l><l xml:id="m-8705e4ab-c2f9-466d-b95c-bec99f496c28" facs="#m-28d4ad8e-412f-4ae6-ad19-47c422af8dd8" label="lyrics-like">sa-lu- tá- re tú¬ um exsul-tá¬</l><l xml:id="m-74a948a0-a0f5-4b28-aa40-1b564ef0d223" facs="#m-aabca2c5-4489-4f31-8498-d0b6dd0bfae7" label="ambiguous">ter.</l><l xml:id="m-d9b5665e-d508-40eb-8edd-1e0306dde2d2" facs="#m-83bf166d-3227-4d65-ab6e-13a033a31265" label="lyrics-like">ve¬ he- mén¬</l><l xml:id="m-55a26bcb-d323-466f-b860-c7152cf3073a" facs="#m-0876846c-79ad-41d7-98e9-26c22bf8f6a8" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. Matth. S. c.</l><l xml:id="m-4420c874-511f-4f21-a824-ff223ac82301" facs="#m-70d5deec-6e52-4e1f-b69d-bdc5b4771b87" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus discí- suo, raca: reus erit concflio. Qui</l><l xml:id="m-8f513aba-fbe8-4aa0-8aef-d66184a946b1" facs="#m-116af452-ed49-4400-9866-c187199d30b4" label="lyrics-like">L pulis suis : Nisi abundáverit iu¬</l><l xml:id="m-ef932626-0811-4b6a-bf11-ffb64513c91a" facs="#m-a9f0499b-4f56-4903-95da-1649f625ce57" label="lyrics-like">autem díxerit, fá̂tue: reus erit xe¬</l><l xml:id="m-baa7bb66-27db-493a-9ea2-939704e00b8e" facs="#m-cc1b29ef-14cb-45a9-98f4-9c5af76ea21b" label="lyrics-like">hénnae ignis. Si ergo offers munus</l><l xml:id="m-87a51cb4-913f-4637-aac4-9ff4d634600f" facs="#m-6201c9d2-5bd1-4861-ba20-dd38ddd63a8d" label="lyrics-like">stitia vestra plus quam Scribárum</l><l xml:id="m-f1789577-81f9-41d9-ae7e-1122ad7ee503" facs="#m-a9fc5557-6e31-4a18-acec-8466a2d6811f" label="lyrics-like">tuum ad altáre, et ibi recordátus</l><l xml:id="m-8e2845f1-27ac-46cf-89b1-bd68aa639056" facs="#m-0d3bfc89-95c6-4724-8ff4-6f91cb011498" label="lyrics-like">et Pharisaeórum, non intrábitis in</l><l xml:id="m-ae420db6-0884-4a3d-bc46-349640c5609a" facs="#m-35dcccf5-73fb-4314-a9d4-52e0a0f2763e" label="lyrics-like">fúeris, quia frater tuus habet áli¬</l><l xml:id="m-073bb502-16f6-4cad-838b-3625247ec571" facs="#m-6d637628-d631-49b9-a8bf-1f7b7508ff1d" label="lyrics-like">regnum caclórum. Audístis, quia</l><l xml:id="m-184e730f-5262-427a-8b37-1459af2b80d7" facs="#m-e13fc7cb-d7e0-4e94-a380-2518cf6651c5" label="lyrics-like">dictum est antíquis: Non occides:</l><l xml:id="m-d49622a6-ff04-42e5-bcad-8c8aeba4f36e" facs="#m-88e06d95-9087-4d3e-aa4f-cdea3a63e8fb" label="lyrics-like">quid advérsum te: relinque ibi mu¬</l><l xml:id="m-68a3e4b5-31e3-4be1-a0ba-04db74e136aa" facs="#m-d0592a47-f1a5-4817-9ae8-ebdf07e8e678" label="ambiguous">qui autem occiderit, reus erit judi¬</l><l xml:id="m-2b6796d9-c240-4150-9eea-86300936a66a" facs="#m-2a578e03-5e21-4ddf-a11f-c385509586b1" label="lyrics-like">nus tuum ante altáre, et vade prius</l><l xml:id="m-27d7da0b-65a1-48f0-b9ec-01720536c0e3" facs="#m-6f0a05ad-c6ef-4219-8587-2e9d2a88b90c" label="lyrics-like">reconciliári fratri tuo: et tunc vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-72c033a1-6ae2-4efd-bb6e-9db4f83e8c87" facs="#m-cb6d0e44-82c9-4a59-a575-ce36cebb7b40" label="ambiguous">cio. Ego autem dico vobis: quia</l><l xml:id="m-58fbb83f-6d6a-4704-8f6d-f32f00f0ac50" facs="#m-78834a65-760e-47c3-9c15-2f71d99eadfb" label="lyrics-like">omnis, qui iráscitur fratri suo, reus</l><l xml:id="m-c99aa5c3-d8bc-42ae-ad20-d8a412a19b16" facs="#m-b04e5997-cdf2-4661-bae7-1eb9cfa6d15c" label="lyrics-like">niens ófferes munus tuum.</l><l xml:id="m-69d262cb-24e8-4983-84e3-43a04f270750" facs="#m-a5ceddf3-0647-46de-bd72-5c98835ec81f" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-0f226cff-b7e9-44b6-b4db-04edf5344b7f" facs="#m-4890338c-e745-425f-9412-3b792c61322d" label="ambiguous">erit judicio. Qui autem dixerit fratri</l><l xml:id="m-ff271a87-2430-4a55-9503-ad1791c77294" facs="#m-4db91f85-fabc-4202-a0dd-cebf85c3e7e5" label="ambiguous">orert.E</l><l xml:id="m-b6798793-5104-44cd-96f3-328cb7b94d46" facs="#m-c7ff08ec-164b-4076-9146-87c8ad8622c1" label="ambiguous">i.</l><l xml:id="m-e4ff6856-5194-41fa-8287-18828ca0ed33" facs="#m-cc1f2574-30d1-4832-b15e-0b54c42ac01e" label="lyrics-like">Ene-dí-cam Dó¬ mi-num, “ qui mí¬ hi trí-bu¬</l><l xml:id="m-5a3121ff-b239-48df-bc5c-5ec11103f4c8" facs="#m-eee51b88-b7c5-43e8-ac6f-9b085e5f9079" label="lyrics-like">ctum: providébam Dé¬ um</l><l xml:id="m-d3dda036-a990-4fb4-8e25-e06c7fa0fcbc" facs="#m-eaa77b55-5809-453a-8212-b382b2d5338e" label="lyrics-like">it intel-lé¬</l><l xml:id="m-168f6e72-37dd-4999-b510-952710dcf890" facs="#m-2949e91e-a51a-479e-aff9-f84bb1da6959" label="lyrics-like">in conspé-ctu mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-cbab7f7f-5a70-4d5e-b665-b79da1c44c98" facs="#m-3a8f01d7-b647-424f-bfa6-a3a4e83b6d1f" label="lyrics-like">osem-per: quóni¬ am</l></lg>
